<title>SOUTH AFRICA: De Beers denies big dollar sale last week.</title>
<headline>De Beers denies big dollar sale last week.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diamond giant De Beers Consolidated Mines on Thursday denied it had placed a large dollar sell order in the foreign exchange market at the end of last week.</p>
<p>The company's treasury department said a Reuter market report last Friday suggesting there had been such an order -- which one dealer had put at around $100 million -- was incorrect.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
